Here is a complete dashboard UI that displays your metrics overview. 

It consists of two dynamic columns:
1. **Left Column**: A vertical stack featuring a section header and a **Metric Row** containing 4 KPI tiles (Revenue, New Customers, Churn Rate, and Support CSAT), each formatted with its respective value, label, trend indicator, and accent color.
2. **Right Column**: A vertical stack featuring a section header and a **Chart.js Bar Chart** comparing target vs. actual monthly revenues.

### 1. Surface Creation

First, we initialize the UI surface:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "metrics-overview-dashboard",
    "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-data-display.json"
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

### 2. Component Layout & Data

Next, we populate the surface with our top-down layout structure. The `columns` component acts as the root, containing nested grids and charts:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "metrics-overview-dashboard",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "columns",
        "cols": 2,
        "gap": "2rem",
        "align": "top",
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "kpi-section-heading",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Key Performance Indicators"
              },
              {
                "id": "kpi-metrics-grid",
                "component": "metric_row",
                "cols": 2,
                "metrics": [
                  {
                    "value": "$124,500",
                    "label": "Monthly Revenue",
                    "trend": "up",
                    "accent": "#10B981"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "3,240",
                    "label": "New Customers",
                    "trend": "up",
                    "accent": "#10B981"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "1.8%",
                    "label": "Churn Rate",
                    "trend": "down",
                    "accent": "#EF4444"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "94.6%",
                    "label": "Support CSAT",
                    "trend": "up",
                    "accent": "#10B981"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "chart-section-heading",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Monthly Performance Comparison"
              },
              {
                "id": "revenue-comparison-chart",
                "component": "chartjs_bar",
                "labels": ["Jul", "Aug", "Sep", "Oct", "Nov", "Dec"],
                "datasets": [
                  {
                    "label": "Target Revenue ($k)",
                    "data": [100, 110, 115, 120, 125, 130]
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Actual Revenue ($k)",
                    "data": [105, 112, 124, 118, 128, 135]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
</a2ui-json>
